      ⍝ Bugs39 #2: f⍤[X] on an empty frame with a scalar-valued f is AXIS ERROR




      (+/⍤[1]1) 0 3⍴0
AXIS ERROR+
      (+/⍤[1]1)0 3⍴0
      ^




      (⊂⍤[1]0) 0⍴0
AXIS ERROR+
      (⊂⍤[1]0)0⍴0
      ^




      (0 3⍴0)(+.×⍤[1]1) 0 3⍴0
AXIS ERROR+
      (0 3⍴0)(+.×⍤[1]1)0 3⍴0
      ^      ^




      ⍝ Bugs39 #3: resuming a dangling-function SYNTAX ERROR repeats it




      1+(+/)
SYNTAX ERROR+
      1+(+/)
           ^




      →⍬
SYNTAX ERROR+
      1+(+/)
           ^




      )SIC




      ⍝ Bugs39 #4: no selective specification of a structured variable itself




