      (1↑¨S39)←'z'
DOMAIN ERROR+
      (1↑¨S39)←'z'
          ^   ^




      (7 2⌷S39)←⊂'q'
DOMAIN ERROR+
      (7 2⌷S39)←⊂'q'
           ^   ^




      S39.b
xy




      (⊃S39.a)←7




      S39.a
7 7 7




      )ERASE S39




      ⍝ Bugs39 #5: a defined function left of → in a lambda is a SYNTAX ERROR




